sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User/Device
    participant IdP as Identity Provider
    participant VA as Verified Access
    participant Policy as Policy Engine
    participant FW as Network Firewall
    participant App as Application

    User->>IdP: Authenticate (username + MFA)
    IdP-->>User: Identity token
    User->>VA: Access request + token
    VA->>IdP: Validate token
    IdP-->>VA: Token valid
    VA->>Policy: Evaluate access policy
    
    Note over Policy: Check user, device, context
    
    alt Access Granted
        Policy-->>VA: Allow
        VA->>FW: Forward request
        FW->>FW: Inspect traffic
        FW->>App: Deliver request
        App-->>User: Response
    else Access Denied
        Policy-->>VA: Deny
        VA-->>User: Access denied
    end

    VA->>VA: Log access decision
